		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なかまが　くるまで　とは
いつまで　なんだろうな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-09T07:04:47" />
